  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Paul Markland is a British former merchant navy captain and shipping executive. Raised in South Devon, he entered the merchant navy after missing a place in further education. His career took him from supertankers and command of a diving support vessel to work in Mexico and Hong Kong, before settling in Salcombe.",
    "html": "<p>Paul Markland is a British former merchant navy captain and shipping executive. Raised in South Devon, he entered the merchant navy after missing a place in further education. His career took him from supertankers and command of a diving support vessel to work in Mexico and Hong Kong, before settling in Salcombe.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 52,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 88,
      "band": "high",
      "reason": "Firsthand career, travel diary, auction provenance and primary charity records support bounded profile."
    },
